ama\u00f1o del archivo puede ser mayor de 1GB. Esto puede requerir que abras espacio en tu dispositivo. Se recomienda descargar la aplicaci\u00f3n mientras est\u00e1s conectado a trav\u00e9s de wifi. ", "short_description": "Nuestra experiencia de realidad virtual ofrece una vista de primera mano a los peligros de manejar distra\u00eddo.\nAl seleccionar e instalar la aplicaci\u00f3n de la Simulaci\u00f3n de Puede Esperar, usted acepta el acuerdo de licencia de la Simulaci\u00f3n de Puede Esperar ubicado en http://itcanwait.com/vr"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://itcanwait.com/vr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://itcanwait.com/vr", "publisher_name": "AT&T Services, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.att.com.mx/puedeesperar", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "201797992132790"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12727894_225127271290159_2102598452323024896_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JMjm4GEcA20Q7kNvwG9P3n1&_nc_oc=AdpcMRBxmUoyCx1cI4BkijNR9nbub3XfiX2GsB-fJDhjWhvr2UHacfNe7HIMdlaQHeY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSw6vxkIZ2MujJR06iM_IVqlPlWvOY1gC3IAqyZqKnKSA&oe=6B032629"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Puede Esperar", "platform": "ANDROID", "cont